/target
in*.pdf
out*.pdf
*.docx.pdf
*test*.pdf
# bugs/ fixtures are never gitignored (~/.claude/rules/bug-reports.md) — the
# scratch-PDF patterns above would otherwise silently swallow files like
# bugs/bug-0001/input-4page.pdf.
!bugs/**
# ...except build output from a repro crate, the one ignore the rule permits there.
bugs/**/target/
# ...and except OS cruft. `!bugs/**` overrides ~/.gitignore_global for this subtree,
# so without this line a Finder-created .DS_Store inside bugs/ or any bugs/bug-NNNN/
# fixture directory becomes committable — and fixtures ARE committed by convention,
# so it would stick. Re-ignore it here, after the negation, where it wins.
.DS_Store
.cargo/config.toml
.claude/settings.local.json
.publish-bin.toml
.install-bin.toml
